WEBVTT

00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:06.470
Who is that? Who? Who?

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:12.740
That is the devil! Devilman! Devilman!

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:14.540
DEVILMAN

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:22.020
This man took on the name "traitor"
He threw away everything to fight

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:25.760
His Devil Arrow is a supersonic wave
His Devil Ears can hear anything

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:29.430
His Devil Wing lets him fly through the air
His Devil Beam is a ray of heat

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:36.410
With the power of a devil inside him

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:45.280
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:56.430
This man first learned of human love
That kindness awakened him

00:00:56.720 --> 00:01:00.630
His Devil Chop has punching power
His Devil Kick has destructive power

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:04.290
His Devil Eye has X-ray power
His Devil Cutter can break through rocks

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:11.440
With the power of a devil inside him

00:01:11.730 --> 00:01:20.350
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:36.940
DEMON OF THE SNOW
LALA

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:47.900
SILVER MOUNTAIN EXPRESS

00:02:01.250 --> 00:02:04.220
Geez, there sure are a
lot of idle people here.

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:05.920
You're one of them.

00:02:05.920 --> 00:02:09.090
Stupid! I was just reluctant
to come with you and Tare.

00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:11.590
Speaking of, where'd Tare go?

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:14.600
- He's gone out.
- Out where?

00:02:14.600 --> 00:02:16.010
You know, just out.

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:26.780
Hello!

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:35.880
A ghost!

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:47.070
A monster!

00:03:03.580 --> 00:03:06.110
S-Sis! There's a ghost!

00:03:06.110 --> 00:03:07.920
A ghost? Honestly, pull
yourself together!

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:10.350
I swear! I saw it!

00:03:10.350 --> 00:03:13.360
What are you talking about?
I wonder if there really was one...

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:15.630
All right, I'm gonna go check it out.

00:03:32.070 --> 00:03:33.780
Huh? Is that...

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:37.280
Devilman!

00:03:41.580 --> 00:03:42.580
Wait!

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:48.920
I'm positive that was Lala
of the Demon Tribe!

00:03:53.860 --> 00:03:56.160
That ghost must have been Lala.

00:03:56.160 --> 00:03:58.700
I can't believe Xenon would
send out such a dope.

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:00.930
Akira!

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:04.610
C'mon, hurry up! The
bus is about to leave!

00:04:21.990 --> 00:04:23.290
Wow, how beautiful!

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:25.630
Pretty! I hope
we get there soon!

00:04:25.630 --> 00:04:27.070
I'm so excited!

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:56.830
- It was another bear attack!
- That makes three now!

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:59.860
Woah, did they say “bear“?
How scary!

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:01.200
Will we be all right?

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:04.330
Yes, as long as the locals
stay on alert like this.

00:05:04.330 --> 00:05:06.030
The bears will eventually have
to go back into the mountains.

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:07.380
Come on, let's go.

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:16.520
I can't believe bears would just
go in among people like that.

00:05:18.810 --> 00:05:21.050
All right, I'm gonna ski
to my head's content!

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:22.190
Let's ski! Let's ski!

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:25.690
You'll do a lot more
falling than skiing!

00:05:46.940 --> 00:05:50.310
I heard Lala went to the human world.

00:05:50.310 --> 00:05:52.980
Really, that little coward?

00:05:52.980 --> 00:05:57.400
Is it really that surprising?
She wants to show off her pretty face!

00:05:57.850 --> 00:06:01.460
The face she molded with
her magic, you mean?

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:02.870
What an idiot!

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:24.650
Lala, come here at once!

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:28.390
Yes, sir! You want me to
defeat Devilman, right?

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:32.390
You little fool!
You are no match for Devilman!

00:06:32.390 --> 00:06:35.090
Even you call me a fool!

00:06:35.090 --> 00:06:37.020
It's true, I am a fool!

00:06:37.030 --> 00:06:41.090
The biggest fool of the Demon Tribe!
There is no cure for stupidity!

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:45.100
Only death will cure a fool!

00:06:46.400 --> 00:06:47.970
Stop it!

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:50.280
That is exactly why
you are a fool!

00:06:51.440 --> 00:06:54.470
Enough of this!
You are beautiful!

00:06:54.480 --> 00:06:57.120
Oh my!
Demon Lord, I love you!

00:06:58.050 --> 00:07:00.910
I shall just have to suffer
that. Listen well, Lala.

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:03.550
Go to the human world and speak to Dodo.

00:07:03.550 --> 00:07:06.790
If he is discovered, Devilman
may attempt to challenge him.

00:07:06.790 --> 00:07:09.060
Now, he must kill
as many humans as possible

00:07:09.060 --> 00:07:12.530
without being discovered.

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:21.110
That's what Lord Xenon said.
Do you understand, Dodo?

00:07:21.970 --> 00:07:23.900
I understand, but I also do not.

00:07:23.910 --> 00:07:28.010
Huh? You know I'm not
that bright. Please explain.

00:07:28.580 --> 00:07:32.280
Lord Xenon said to kill
as many men as possible.

00:07:32.280 --> 00:07:36.480
If Akira Fudo is one of those men, then
Xenon will not mind me killing him, right?

00:07:36.480 --> 00:07:39.590
"Akira Fudo"?
Devilman is here?

00:07:39.590 --> 00:07:41.690
He has been here since yesterday.

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:45.800
I shall use my powers of
transformation to kill him!

00:07:46.990 --> 00:07:49.740
Another victim has arrived.

00:08:21.900 --> 00:08:24.170
Tare!
The bathroom's over there.

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:25.540
Oh, really?

00:09:00.400 --> 00:09:02.070
It's so nice out!

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:04.980
I like skiing, but I'm tired
of waiting for the lift.

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:13.180
Hey, there's another lift up there!

00:09:13.880 --> 00:09:15.990
Huh, how long has that been there?

00:09:16.480 --> 00:09:18.490
I didn't notice it yesterday.

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:20.990
Never mind that, let's go!

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:54.990
That's weird. Where does this lift go?

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:56.530
And somethings weird about the height.

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:08.410
When did we go so far away?
This is too fishy!

00:10:44.140 --> 00:10:48.140
DEVIL!

00:10:54.220 --> 00:10:57.360
Time to unmask you, killer bear!

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:36.620
Where is it? Where'd it go?

00:11:36.620 --> 00:11:41.040
No, The lift stopped!
Get me down!

00:11:41.660 --> 00:11:43.010
Where are you, demon?

00:11:45.370 --> 00:11:46.440
Hello!

00:11:47.370 --> 00:11:48.680
Lala, it's you!

00:11:48.940 --> 00:11:49.710
Wait!

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:56.150
Dammit!

00:12:14.730 --> 00:12:16.170
Y-You are...

00:12:22.900 --> 00:12:24.770
It's you, Dodo! I thought this was
a little too clever for Lala.

00:12:24.770 --> 00:12:27.840
Even Devilman looks down on me!

00:12:27.840 --> 00:12:30.080
How do you like my living net?

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:32.650
Not even you can break out of it!

00:12:32.650 --> 00:12:33.750
Damn!

00:12:38.590 --> 00:12:40.690
Cool your heels here for a while.

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:43.500
- Lala, let's go.
- Where are you going?

00:12:44.020 --> 00:12:45.990
To kill them all!

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:48.470
That is Lord Xenon's order. Please
do not hold it against me.

00:12:49.130 --> 00:12:52.470
Even if you say that, he'll
still hold it against me!

00:12:52.470 --> 00:12:54.070
Stay out of this!

00:12:56.540 --> 00:12:58.480
Shut up, you're beautiful!

00:12:59.310 --> 00:13:01.380
Dodo, I love you.

00:13:02.580 --> 00:13:05.110
Very well. Proceed with
your next task at once.

00:13:10.450 --> 00:13:12.230
What do you plan on doing,
disguised as me?

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:18.090
I hope that living net
strangles you to death!

00:13:19.130 --> 00:13:22.370
Shit, he plans on killing the humans!
That wretched Dodo!

00:13:29.140 --> 00:13:31.170
- Hey, it's Akira!
- Ah, you're right!

00:13:31.170 --> 00:13:32.870
Hey, Akira!

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:33.870
Huh?

00:13:34.940 --> 00:13:37.420
- Who is that?
- Dunno.

00:13:37.850 --> 00:13:40.950
Hi! How's everybody today?

00:13:40.950 --> 00:13:42.580
She's awfully friendly, isn't she?

00:13:42.580 --> 00:13:44.080
And beautiful, too!

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:47.500
She doesn't look very smart.
Is that the kind of girl Akira likes?

00:13:48.190 --> 00:13:51.760
I swear I've seen
her before, though.

00:13:57.930 --> 00:14:00.170
Damn! I can't move at all!

00:14:04.540 --> 00:14:08.610
Devil Beam!

00:14:12.010 --> 00:14:15.760
Dammit.
I can't even use my main attack?

00:14:23.360 --> 00:14:25.530
There is fresh snow tonight.

00:14:25.530 --> 00:14:27.470
Perfect for causing an avalanche!

00:14:44.810 --> 00:14:46.750
Is something wrong, Tare?

00:14:46.750 --> 00:14:48.880
I swear I've seen you before!

00:14:48.880 --> 00:14:50.750
Where at?

00:14:50.750 --> 00:14:55.090
There's no way I could forget
someone as beautiful as you!

00:14:55.090 --> 00:14:56.630
Tare, I love you!

00:14:58.830 --> 00:15:00.770
Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:15:01.600 --> 00:15:03.760
Can't you keep it down in here?!

00:15:03.760 --> 00:15:06.680
How am I supposed to
sleep with all this noise?!

00:15:07.270 --> 00:15:09.340
No way, it's Mr. Alphonne!

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:10.970
You showed up just in time!

00:15:10.970 --> 00:15:15.610
That's right! I'm here at
the request of my many fans!

00:15:15.610 --> 00:15:18.280
Come Miki, shall we dance?

00:15:19.610 --> 00:15:21.250
Akira Fudo...

00:15:21.820 --> 00:15:22.850
No!

00:15:23.420 --> 00:15:25.330
Mademoiselle, shall we dance?

00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:30.290
- What a beauty!
- Oh my, what a mug.

00:15:35.300 --> 00:15:36.000
Much better.

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:44.950
Now, let us finish this!

00:15:51.250 --> 00:15:52.420
Come on, let's go!

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:56.390
I know a great slope.
Come with me, guys!

00:15:58.650 --> 00:16:00.390
I can't wait!

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:04.140
Just wait and see.

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:22.890
DANGER

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:33.890
We're nearly there.

00:16:33.890 --> 00:16:38.160
Once they arrive, one shout
will bring down an avalanche.

00:16:38.160 --> 00:16:40.030
Then they will all die!

00:16:40.030 --> 00:16:43.030
That sounds fun, but
I feel bad for them.

00:16:43.030 --> 00:16:44.700
Do not be a fool!

00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:46.700
But I am a fool!

00:16:48.340 --> 00:16:49.610
Oh no!

00:17:00.710 --> 00:17:01.820
Blast!

00:17:12.130 --> 00:17:13.700
Avalanche!

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:30.980
Devil Beam!

00:17:40.220 --> 00:17:42.960
I was almost killed
in that avalanche!

00:17:43.820 --> 00:17:44.930
You damn fool!

00:17:47.130 --> 00:17:48.300
Just a moment.

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:52.670
There is no point
in arguing with you!

00:17:52.670 --> 00:17:55.030
I shall devour them all!

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:56.780
I'd like to see you try!

00:18:03.180 --> 00:18:03.880
Wait!

00:18:12.250 --> 00:18:13.700
Damn, you're not getting away!

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:30.520
He's hiding in the snow?

00:18:33.010 --> 00:18:35.280
Devil Arrow!

00:18:47.090 --> 00:18:48.070
You won't get away, Dodo!

00:19:03.900 --> 00:19:05.850
Disguising yourself as snow, huh?

00:19:06.210 --> 00:19:08.710
Devil Beam!

00:19:18.190 --> 00:19:19.790
Devilman, now you've done it!

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:21.920
You angling for a fight, too?

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:25.260
Of course! I am a pan of
the Demon Tribe, after all!

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:26.570
Prepare yourself, Devilman!

00:19:28.930 --> 00:19:31.030
Ouch!

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:36.100
It broke!

00:19:36.100 --> 00:19:38.900
Akira's more trouble
than he's worth!

00:19:38.910 --> 00:19:41.410
Hey, Akira's back!

00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:42.980
Let me go!

00:19:42.980 --> 00:19:46.450
I'm the most beautiful
woman in the Demon Tribe!

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:47.550
I said no!

00:19:47.550 --> 00:19:49.650
What's with her, Akira?

00:19:49.650 --> 00:19:52.820
Nothing! She's just a little...

00:19:52.820 --> 00:19:53.920
You know?

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:56.960
Poor thing!
And she's so pretty, too!

00:19:57.420 --> 00:20:00.060
Tare, I love you.

00:20:02.360 --> 00:20:03.860
No thanks!

00:20:08.770 --> 00:20:10.580
MENTAL HOSPITAL

00:20:14.240 --> 00:20:15.470
I hope you'll be happy there.

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:18.220
You'll live longer than anyone
else in the Demon Tribe.

00:20:19.980 --> 00:20:23.290
I remember! She was
the ghost on the train!

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:49.970
No one knows; no one may know

00:20:51.680 --> 00:20:56.680
Who Devilman really is

00:20:57.520 --> 00:21:04.330
No one speaks; no one may say

00:21:04.720 --> 00:21:10.170
Who Devilman really is

00:21:11.030 --> 00:21:14.130
In the world of man, there is love

00:21:14.130 --> 00:21:17.340
In the world of man, there are dreams

00:21:17.340 --> 00:21:22.340
Wanting only to protect
these beautiful things,

00:21:24.480 --> 00:21:33.190
Devilman is off, somewhere, today

00:21:47.330 --> 00:21:53.220
No one knows; no one may know

00:21:54.170 --> 00:21:59.420
Where Devilman comes from

00:21:59.910 --> 00:22:04.910
No one speaks; no one may say

00:22:07.050 --> 00:22:12.050
Where Devilman comes from

00:22:13.460 --> 00:22:16.800
For he can never go home again

00:22:16.800 --> 00:22:19.800
He wanders on a journey

00:22:19.800 --> 00:22:26.510
Now that he understands peace

00:22:26.940 --> 00:22:36.630
He'll be Devilman again,
somewhere, tomorrow

00:22:58.810 --> 00:23:03.720
After Muxan's death, who will
control the demons next?

00:23:04.680 --> 00:23:09.720
Under Xenon's orders, the next to
appear is the Demon Marshal Lacock.

00:23:10.450 --> 00:23:17.800
Her first assassin is the Demon
Jewel, who controls human desire.

00:23:28.570 --> 00:23:33.980
A rain of jewels falls from the sky,
causing humans to show their greed.

00:23:35.380 --> 00:23:37.910
Their desires spread and spread,

00:23:37.910 --> 00:23:44.730
and before long it develops into an
unprecedented series of crimes.

00:23:47.490 --> 00:23:52.460
Here and there, humans become
beasts and commit atrocious acts.

00:23:58.260 --> 00:24:02.200
After Lala manages to escape
from the mental hospital,

00:24:02.200 --> 00:24:04.700
what will become of her and the others?

00:24:04.700 --> 00:24:09.700
But although Lala had previously
worked together with Devilman,

00:24:09.880 --> 00:24:13.350
Lala, faithful to the Demon
Tribe, comes after him.

00:24:14.350 --> 00:24:16.790
Is someone controlling Lala?

00:24:23.360 --> 00:24:26.460
At last, Demon Jewel reveals himself.

00:24:27.390 --> 00:24:29.360
His body is made out of diamond

00:24:29.360 --> 00:24:31.570
so that not even the Devil
Cutter will work on it.

00:24:32.070 --> 00:24:34.880
Devilman is driven to
the depths of despair.

00:24:36.370 --> 00:24:42.450
As Devilman struggles, Lacock's
eerie laughter can be heard nearby.

00:24:43.810 --> 00:24:45.240
Next time on Devilman:

00:24:45.250 --> 00:24:49.090
DEMON JEWEL
LIMITLESS DESIRES
